
* Ordinary Dirac algebra. No gamma-five, colour algebra or trace of open chains.
* Unit-normalised native traces; each occurrence already carries TraceOfOne.
@TRACES@
.sort
#procedure cfcDiracCanonical
repeat;
@RULES@
@EPSILON@
endrepeat;
#endprocedure
#call cfcDiracCanonical
* Restore the public native gamma vocabulary only after the rewrite loop.
id cfcOpen(?a) = g_(1,?a);
